          <p>The core principles for Shopify GEO in 2026:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Structured product data</strong>: complete, accurate product schema markup so AI systems can extract price, availability, reviews, and specifications programmatically.</li>
            <li><strong>Conversational FAQ content</strong>: AI systems synthesise answers from content that matches how people actually ask questions. FAQPage schema and natural-language Q&amp;A content significantly increases the chance of being cited.</li>
            <li><strong>Authoritative brand positioning</strong>: AI systems synthesise from sources they assess as credible. Reviews, press mentions, and consistent NAP data across platforms all contribute to AI trustworthiness signals.</li>
            <li><strong>Clear purchase pathways</strong>: AI-referred visitors arrive ready to buy. Ensure your product pages have clear pricing, availability, and add-to-cart CTAs accessible programmatically.</li>
